ネスパートナー兼エクソシストで、娘と父親のような関係で、お互いを嫌っているように見えるが、危険が迫るといつもうまく協力し合う。\n具体的な内容はなく、すべてあなたにお任せします。キーワードとしては、美しい田園風景や庭、心霊スポット、サーカスやお祭り、教会や墓場などが考えられます。不気味さ、ホラー、血の要素も歓迎ですが、必要ありません。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1U7uD9l4i3K2XXExYsZpChwFGQBo9tFei?usp=share_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@N_L_M_G/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2537452, "client_id": 2089201, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5885fe2c0396331e93fd5db3682fdb2b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5885fe2c0396331e93fd5db3682fdb2b, https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d07c68971f43a9e0ea1521ee06514f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4748117751dbd06dca139b3ea45ba23 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd025abc1871540882c41fed59ce33c0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd025abc1871540882c41fed59ce33c0, https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=caa0bec565c45c97ccf4f89d0ef17b0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/049c54dc/uploads/origins/e1cf9c08-6037-4f4d-ba35-e9daaf96d7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=841350d0513a5ddd6a32bb9ae7c41f63 3x"}, "body": "Would you like to draw these two original characters? They are Vampire and Hunter who are enemies but at the same time have to work together.\n-Vampire\nA merchant whose greed is strong to the point that he even wants to control others' fate. There is a red crystal earring on his left ear. He has a devilish personality, and searching for something could make him satisfied in his eternal life.\n-Hunter\nA veteran who wants to take revenge for his military squad. He is a strong and brave man who acts too hard on himself. He is a soldier who is used to violence.\nThe background of their story was in the 18th century, located in Central Asia and Europe. The Hunter tried to take revenge at first, but he failed. Instead of killing The Hunter, The Vampire asked him to do some favor. In their partnered Journey, The Vampire grew a strange obsession with the Hunter.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vIgq60-9Q_ipy8YBCFIlwiM01GAJ875B", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@N_L_M_G/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2537452, "client_id": 1500785, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d9976e2/uploads/origins/b67b3d8e-3386-4682-a99e-6bc588dde24b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ec5e35acfe03422a0d7634c1486e875", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d9976e2/uploads/origins/b67b3d8e-3386-4682-a99e-6bc588dde24b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ec5e35acfe03422a0d7634c1486e875, https://si.imgix.net/1d9976e2/uploads/origins/b67